WEBVTT

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:05.610
What are you doing, Quiche?

00:00:06.490 --> 00:00:08.330
Tart! Pie!

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:14.030
How shameful! You’ve been continually beaten!

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:17.710
Don’t worry though.

00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:22.590
Now that we’re here, we’ll get rid of those humans.

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:23.290
Pie!

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:26.640
Let’s take out those Mew-Mew!

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:28.010
Wait!

00:00:28.010 --> 00:00:30.130
I have my pride too!

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:32.050
Results are our only concern.

00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:33.050
What do you mean?

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:36.020
We just have to win.

00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:38.520
Pride only gets in the way.

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:40.100
You’re immature...

00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:44.490
Just stay out of our way.

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:05.460
Oh, darn.

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:08.100
Aoyama-kun isn’t here today.

00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:11.930
I’ll have to put a bell on you.

00:01:14.430 --> 00:01:16.850
Don’t run off by yourself anymore...

00:01:17.520 --> 00:01:19.640
Because you’re my cat, Ichigo.

00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:23.190
...just kidding!

00:01:28.230 --> 00:01:30.030
Oh, how embarrassing...

00:01:30.030 --> 00:01:31.940
You don’t mean I’m your... hmm?

00:01:38.490 --> 00:01:40.990
Argh what’s this? A Chimera Anima?

00:01:40.990 --> 00:01:42.620
How dare you?!

00:01:47.030 --> 00:01:48.370
Please don’t move!

00:02:04.940 --> 00:02:07.110
Is that a new cake?

00:02:07.110 --> 00:02:09.570
Yes, it’s a birthday cake.

00:02:09.570 --> 00:02:11.270
I’ve no intention of selling it, though.

00:02:11.270 --> 00:02:13.780
Is it your birthday?

00:02:14.240 --> 00:02:15.450
Nope...

00:02:15.450 --> 00:02:17.250
It’s not mine.

00:02:18.120 --> 00:02:21.920
Um... what kind of plate should we use for today’s special cake?

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:25.250
Um, Akasaka-san?

00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:27.250
Eh? Anything wrong?

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:41.610
You’re studying butterflies?

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:44.440
Yeah. I was a little too into it...

00:02:44.440 --> 00:02:45.600
I’m really sorry...

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:48.490
No, no, it’s alright.

00:02:55.990 --> 00:02:56.990
Specifically,

00:02:56.990 --> 00:03:04.630
I’m researching their habitation to find out their ecological potential, and that...

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:10.620
Oh, I’m sorry.
I’m apologizing a lot today.

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:14.260
Simply put,

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:16.360
I study the number of butterflies and their species.

00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:19.390
If their numbers grow, then the environment around Tokyo is okay.

00:03:19.390 --> 00:03:21.310
If they deplete, then we’re in trouble.

00:03:21.310 --> 00:03:25.270
Oh. You should’ve said so earlier.

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:29.570
The numbers have been
depleting recently.

00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:30.980
Is that so?

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:36.770
It could be changes in the environment or just other reasons,

00:03:36.770 --> 00:03:38.690
but we can’t figure out the case.

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:42.450
Sounds like a lot of work.

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:44.160
But I love butterflies.

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:47.420
They’re so pretty...

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:50.080
And they seem so free,

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:52.430
flying around anywhere they want...

00:03:58.090 --> 00:04:00.800
It’s about time I return to the lab.

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:03.810
It’s odd to say this after I caught you with the net,

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:05.270
...but it’s been nice meeting you.

00:04:05.270 --> 00:04:06.390
Uh huh...

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:08.270
I’m Nishina Rei, and you are?

00:04:09.480 --> 00:04:11.730
Um... I’m Momomiya Ichigo.

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:13.730
Oh, what a cute name!

00:04:14.570 --> 00:04:16.150
You think so?

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:18.190
I hope we meet again, bye!

00:04:19.740 --> 00:04:22.150
She’s pretty, but a little weird.

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:32.590
A good spirit...

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:34.750
So let’s take it!

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:37.210
Wait. There’s no need to hurry.

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:38.700
Why not?

00:04:38.700 --> 00:04:40.420
We can use her as bait.

00:04:42.760 --> 00:04:45.440
Hrmm, that sounds like fun.

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:49.890
Here, your order of Rose Tea and Strawberry Tart.

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:51.320
Uh, thanks.

00:04:53.310 --> 00:04:57.740
You’re kidding... you mean pleasant, calm and cool Akasaka-san?

00:04:58.530 --> 00:05:00.740
He was acting somewhat strange...

00:05:00.740 --> 00:05:03.240
He seems to be designing a birthday cake for someone, but...

00:05:07.290 --> 00:05:12.500
He must have been invited to a birthday party! Everyone at school does it!

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:14.340
No way, he’s not a kid like you.

00:05:14.340 --> 00:05:16.050
How rude!

00:05:16.050 --> 00:05:17.670
Bu-Ling is not a kid!

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:18.500
Which part of you isn’t?

00:05:21.010 --> 00:05:25.420
The calendar was marked.
And the marked day is tomorrow.

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:27.010
Tomorrow?

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:28.430
Whose birthday will it be?

00:05:29.520 --> 00:05:31.310
Table 2’s order hasn’t been taken yet.

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:35.380
We weren’t neglecting
our duties, but...

00:05:35.380 --> 00:05:38.560
Nosing into people’s business, just like kids.

00:05:40.090 --> 00:05:41.570
Oneesama...

00:05:47.120 --> 00:05:48.780
You seem bored.

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:54.260
Since I was told not to do anything by a certain someone.

00:05:55.630 --> 00:05:58.670
Did you guys return without accomplishing anything?

00:05:58.670 --> 00:06:01.710
Attacking rashly increases the likelihood of failure.

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:04.100
Bah, whatever!

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:14.310
What? I missed him again?

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:16.520
Aoyama-kun, I want to see you...

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:31.200
I’m sorry.

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:32.960
R-Rei-san?

00:06:41.260 --> 00:06:43.260
I’m really sorry.

00:06:43.260 --> 00:06:45.670
It’s a good thing that your office was so close.

00:06:50.390 --> 00:06:52.110
This is amazing.

00:06:52.110 --> 00:06:53.180
It’s so pretty...

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:56.980
I feel bad about mounting
them, though.

00:06:56.980 --> 00:06:59.690
But there’s no other way
to study them.

00:06:59.690 --> 00:07:01.530
You’re very kind...

00:07:01.530 --> 00:07:03.980
You’re the second person
to have said that.

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:07.900
Oh, it’s nothing...

00:07:08.430 --> 00:07:13.370
Well, let me drive you home as an apology. I’m staying here tonight, so I have time.

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:16.870
Ah haa, it’s okay... I have to get to work anyway.

00:07:17.420 --> 00:07:18.370
To work?

00:07:19.090 --> 00:07:21.330
I’m helping out at a cake store.

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:23.000
Cake?

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:23.670
Hm?

00:07:27.430 --> 00:07:28.590
Is something wrong?

00:07:28.590 --> 00:07:31.220
What is today?

00:07:31.220 --> 00:07:32.430
Oh, that.

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:35.930
The truth is that it’s my birthday today.

00:07:35.930 --> 00:07:37.390
Eh?

00:07:40.310 --> 00:07:42.070
What’s wrong?

00:07:42.070 --> 00:07:43.400
Ah, nothing.

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:48.080
Our pastry chief has spent days making a cake for today...

00:07:48.720 --> 00:07:52.000
And it’s probably a birthday cake...

00:07:53.870 --> 00:07:58.790
But you probably wouldn’t know Akasaka Keiichirou-san, would you? I’m sorry.

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:01.290
Akasaka...

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:02.550
Keiichirou...

00:08:03.090 --> 00:08:09.710
<i>I’m not home right now.
Please leave a message after the beep.</i>

00:08:12.040 --> 00:08:13.730
Keiichirou-san...

00:08:18.480 --> 00:08:19.770
Rei-san?

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:22.520
Oh, I’m sorry. It’s nothing...

00:08:26.090 --> 00:08:29.570
Geez, I was only a little late,

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:34.040
and Minto is making me clean up
after work as punishment.

00:08:34.040 --> 00:08:36.490
She’s so mean.

00:08:37.460 --> 00:08:39.080
Akasaka-san...

00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:41.040
He’s still at it...

00:08:41.820 --> 00:08:44.000
I wonder whose birthday cake it is...

00:08:47.760 --> 00:08:48.970
Butterflies?..

00:08:51.050 --> 00:08:52.840
You sure like spying on people.

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:55.690
How rude!

00:08:55.690 --> 00:08:57.980
But that cake...

00:08:57.980 --> 00:09:02.950
He makes one every year for his old girlfriend’s birthday.

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:04.640
That person is...

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:07.150
Someone who studies butterflies...

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:08.360
Huh?

00:09:30.490 --> 00:09:32.120
But why...

00:09:32.120 --> 00:09:33.910
Why do you want to know?

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:35.540
I’ve...

00:09:35.540 --> 00:09:37.340
...met Rei-san before.

00:09:38.080 --> 00:09:40.550
She seemed very lonely...

00:09:51.350 --> 00:09:55.720
I’m going to help my professor excavate the ruins, we’re close to a breakthrough.

00:09:55.720 --> 00:09:57.450
I think we’ll make a great discovery...

00:09:57.450 --> 00:09:58.980
Congratulations.

00:09:58.980 --> 00:10:00.410
Your dream has come true.

00:10:00.730 --> 00:10:01.990
Thanks.

00:10:03.150 --> 00:10:04.780
Here, look at this...

00:10:04.780 --> 00:10:07.380
We’ll probably find some interesting remains at this hill...

00:10:07.380 --> 00:10:11.310
...we may disprove an established theory in archeology!

00:10:11.310 --> 00:10:12.340
Sounds like fun.

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:18.260
As long as you enjoy it,
I don’t mind...

00:10:27.550 --> 00:10:28.690
I’m sorry...

00:10:29.090 --> 00:10:31.650
I know we haven’t seen each other in awhile, but...

00:10:31.650 --> 00:10:33.800
The office suddenly called me in.

00:10:34.810 --> 00:10:36.990
I really wanted to see you yesterday.

00:10:38.040 --> 00:10:40.660
Today is February 15th...

00:10:42.020 --> 00:10:43.620
Valentine’s Day!

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:46.370
You weren’t the only one
that was busy!

00:10:48.900 --> 00:10:50.080
I’m sorry.

00:10:51.110 --> 00:10:54.290
But, I really wanted to be with you...

00:10:56.580 --> 00:10:58.170
Rei-san...

00:11:01.720 --> 00:11:04.050
<i>There is one message.</i>

00:11:05.630 --> 00:11:07.420
Keiichirou-san...

00:11:07.420 --> 00:11:09.380
I’ve waited for you...

00:11:09.380 --> 00:11:13.600
You said that you prepared a birthday surprise for me.

00:11:14.350 --> 00:11:18.740
I was happy... but I’m going home now.

00:11:20.020 --> 00:11:24.650
Each of us must continue our own studies.

00:11:24.650 --> 00:11:29.580
Perhaps we should also go our separate ways...

00:11:30.070 --> 00:11:33.330
It might be that I didn’t have enough confidence to see you today...

00:11:34.320 --> 00:11:38.880
Keiichirou-san, you’ve always been so kind to me...

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:43.590
I will... remember you always.

00:11:46.090 --> 00:11:47.560
I won’t say goodbye.

00:11:52.550 --> 00:11:56.110
That’s when Keiichirou started to make cakes.

00:11:56.640 --> 00:11:59.480
You got it? This is none of our business.

00:11:59.480 --> 00:12:03.730
They chose their own path... that’s all.

00:12:03.730 --> 00:12:05.030
But I can’t just...

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:05.600
Hey!

00:12:05.600 --> 00:12:06.900
Akasaka-san!

00:12:06.900 --> 00:12:08.400
You’re still here?

00:12:08.400 --> 00:12:09.950
Hey, stop it!

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:13.200
Akasaka-san, you must meet
with Rei-san.

00:12:13.200 --> 00:12:14.120
Let’s go now.

00:12:18.890 --> 00:12:22.840
I’m sure that Rei-san wants to see you again. I just know it...

00:12:24.510 --> 00:12:28.480
Rei-san just wanted you to be able to study whatever you wanted.

00:12:31.550 --> 00:12:34.560
Butterflies are more free than anything, right?

00:12:36.720 --> 00:12:41.530
So... she only left you because she loved you.

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:43.810
You feel the same way, don’t you?

00:12:43.810 --> 00:12:45.490
Isn’t it why you’re making the cake?

00:12:48.650 --> 00:12:50.610
Erm, you guys didn’t leave yet?

00:12:50.610 --> 00:12:52.450
We were just a little worried and...

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:55.650
Akasaka-san, Ichigo is right!

00:12:55.650 --> 00:12:57.660
Let’s go, Akasaka-san!

00:12:57.660 --> 00:13:00.120
Have her eat your cake.

00:13:00.120 --> 00:13:02.260
Then she’ll surely be happy.

00:13:02.260 --> 00:13:06.250
If nothing is done, Rei-san will be tied to her past forever.

00:13:06.250 --> 00:13:09.430
You must untie her... from the past.

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:10.970
Everyone...

00:13:11.630 --> 00:13:13.400
You guys sure are nosy.

00:13:14.050 --> 00:13:15.890
Please, Akasaka-san, let’s go!

00:13:29.710 --> 00:13:31.000
They’re pretty, aren’t they?

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:34.960
I feel bad about mounting
them, though.

00:13:34.960 --> 00:13:37.460
But there’s no other way
to study them.

00:13:39.280 --> 00:13:40.790
You’re very kind...

00:13:45.040 --> 00:13:46.100
W-Who’s there?!

00:13:47.920 --> 00:13:50.930
Now, shall we begin?

00:13:58.010 --> 00:13:59.740
Please don’t touch that butterfly!

00:13:59.740 --> 00:14:02.400
The wings are very poisonous!

00:14:03.600 --> 00:14:04.900
Nice to know...

00:14:12.270 --> 00:14:13.290
Fusion!

00:14:14.020 --> 00:14:16.780
The lights went out. What happened?

00:14:16.780 --> 00:14:18.250
What’s that light?

00:14:18.650 --> 00:14:19.620
Don’t tell me...

00:14:27.250 --> 00:14:30.510
But-ter-flyyyyy!!!

00:14:31.080 --> 00:14:33.670
Why is a Chimera Anima here?

00:14:33.670 --> 00:14:35.430
Everybody transform!

00:14:37.550 --> 00:14:41.930
Mew Mew Strawberry METAMORPHO-SE!

00:14:47.060 --> 00:14:51.110
Mew Mew Mint METAMORPHO-SE!

00:14:53.770 --> 00:14:57.450
Mew Mew Lettuce METAMORPHO-SE!

00:14:59.950 --> 00:15:03.370
Mew Mew Pudding METAMORPHO-SE!

00:15:07.660 --> 00:15:10.350
Mew Mew Pomegranate METAMORPHO-SE!

00:15:23.640 --> 00:15:26.650
We won’t let you interrupt these two lovers’ reunion!

00:15:27.480 --> 00:15:31.660
For the future of these two,
I’ll be of service ~Nya!

00:15:42.660 --> 00:15:44.110
Rei-san!

00:15:44.110 --> 00:15:45.620
Unforgivable...

00:15:45.620 --> 00:15:48.470
How could you steal spirits again and again from innocent women,

00:15:48.470 --> 00:15:50.310
to make Chimera Animas?

00:15:50.310 --> 00:15:51.930
Quiche, where are you?!

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:54.470
So you girls are the Tokyo Mew Mew?

00:15:55.280 --> 00:15:56.850
Who are you?

00:15:55.710 --> 00:15:56.850
You aren’t Quiche.

00:15:56.850 --> 00:15:58.610
Heh! You look weak...

00:15:58.610 --> 00:16:01.810
I can’t believe Quiche
couldn’t handle them.

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:04.050
First, we must test their abilities.

00:16:04.050 --> 00:16:05.820
Go!! Butterfly!

00:16:08.810 --> 00:16:10.100
But-ter-flyyyyy!

00:16:10.100 --> 00:16:10.890
What is this?

00:16:10.890 --> 00:16:11.700
Run!

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:21.550
Those scales contain phosphorus, whose toxicity is hundreds times higher than normal.

00:16:21.550 --> 00:16:23.620
Don’t shower them too much
or they’ll die...

00:16:27.520 --> 00:16:30.070
I’m not... about to let you beat me!

00:16:31.520 --> 00:16:32.680
Argh! Rei-san is stuck...

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:38.600
We will save her DNA as our sample.

00:16:38.600 --> 00:16:40.060
We won’t let you...

00:16:40.060 --> 00:16:41.270
Akasaka-san!

00:16:41.270 --> 00:16:44.730
You guys take care of them.
I’ll help Rei!

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:46.320
How foolish.

00:16:47.870 --> 00:16:49.150
Fuu-Rai-Sen!

00:16:52.430 --> 00:16:53.250
Akasaka-san!

00:16:53.250 --> 00:16:55.240
They’re killing Akasaka-niichan!

00:17:02.260 --> 00:17:06.060
Mmm-mm, as long as you enjoy it, I don’t mind...

00:17:06.060 --> 00:17:08.650
I will never forget you...

00:17:09.100 --> 00:17:11.130
So I won’t say goodbye!

00:17:16.140 --> 00:17:17.840
He never learns!

00:17:21.030 --> 00:17:22.350
Fuu-Rai-Sen!

00:17:22.740 --> 00:17:23.560
NOOooooo!

00:17:29.330 --> 00:17:30.420
Rei!

00:17:31.330 --> 00:17:33.790
Keiichirou... san...

00:17:33.790 --> 00:17:37.340
I’m here. I’m right here.

00:17:37.340 --> 00:17:42.540
Keiichirou-san, I’ve been waiting for you since that day.

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:48.000
I... I didn’t want you to sacrifice anything for me...

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:50.020
I knew...

00:17:50.020 --> 00:17:54.010
...that someday I’d give up my studies and regret it...

00:17:54.770 --> 00:17:59.970
I’m sorry... I’m not strong enough,
parting with the person I love.

00:18:00.650 --> 00:18:05.930
Thank you... risking your life for me.

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:08.600
Keiichirou!

00:18:14.980 --> 00:18:16.210
What the...?!

00:18:16.210 --> 00:18:18.260
He repelled my “Fuu-Rai-Sen.”

00:18:18.750 --> 00:18:20.820
Is it reacting to the forced hostility?

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:25.130
He took the spirit away!

00:18:25.130 --> 00:18:26.390
Mew Strawberry! Now!

00:18:27.430 --> 00:18:29.100
StrawberBell!!

00:18:43.820 --> 00:18:46.850
Reborn Strawberry... CHECK!!

00:18:50.350 --> 00:18:54.360
But-ter-flyyyyyyy!

00:18:56.320 --> 00:18:58.790
Geez, we failed?

00:18:58.790 --> 00:19:01.220
Let’s go back, we’ll get them next time.

00:19:19.480 --> 00:19:21.160
Don’t say anything.

00:19:23.150 --> 00:19:26.360
I made a cake for you...

00:19:26.360 --> 00:19:29.480
But I dropped it.

00:19:30.530 --> 00:19:32.100
Keiichirou-san...

00:19:36.460 --> 00:19:38.650
I believe I can say it now...

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:40.560
“Good bye.”

00:19:42.670 --> 00:19:44.140
And...

00:19:45.020 --> 00:19:46.610
“Thank you.”

00:19:52.350 --> 00:19:54.180
Why?

00:19:54.180 --> 00:19:57.360
I guess they can’t love each other again.

00:19:57.890 --> 00:20:00.350
Somehow, it seems very sad.

00:20:00.350 --> 00:20:02.800
It’s depressing being an adult...

00:20:03.320 --> 00:20:06.230
Rather than staying in one state, she moves on.

00:20:06.650 --> 00:20:08.260
I guess so.

00:20:10.920 --> 00:20:13.730
I’m sure you girls will understand eventually.

00:20:25.090 --> 00:20:28.010
Masha, will fight! Masha, is strong!

00:20:28.010 --> 00:20:31.250
What happened, Masha? You’re hurt!

00:20:31.250 --> 00:20:32.980
Masha, will save you!

00:20:32.980 --> 00:20:34.690
And protect everyone!

00:20:34.690 --> 00:20:35.810
Masha, don’t be rash!

00:20:35.810 --> 00:20:39.220
You don’t have to do such a thing to prove that you’re our friend!

00:20:39.220 --> 00:20:41.740
Ichigo, I believe you.

00:20:41.740 --> 00:20:45.320
So, I WILL protect Ichigo!

00:20:45.320 --> 00:20:48.930
Next: “A Little Hero, Masha:
Friendship at the Risk of His Life”

00:20:48.930 --> 00:20:52.020
I WILL protect Ichigo!

00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:54.230
Masha!!!
